# `public/install` is piped straight into a shell:
#   curl -fsSL https://planckspace.dev/install | sh
# CRLF would reach Linux users as `\r` inside every command. Committing LF is
# currently only luck — it depends on each contributor having core.autocrlf set.
# Pin it here so the repo does not rely on local git config.
public/install text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
